1
00:01:33,009 --> 00:01:38,210
[First Love Again]

2
00:01:38,380 --> 00:01:40,990
[Episode 23]

3
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:01,840
Thank you.

4
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:05,740
I still wanted to thank you in person.

5
00:02:05,950 --> 00:02:07,480
Without the meals you made,

6
00:02:08,030 --> 00:02:11,230
I probably wouldn't have
made it through the semifinals.

7
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:17,079
I'm leaving. Don't stay up too late.

8
00:02:18,190 --> 00:02:20,120
I also wanted to tell you in person.

9
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:21,930
Congratulations.

10
00:02:29,590 --> 00:02:32,050
Congratulations on making it
to the finals.

11
00:02:35,430 --> 00:02:36,760
But what I want to say is,

12
00:02:38,010 --> 00:02:40,870
that doesn't mean I support you
continuing to play.

13
00:02:44,170 --> 00:02:47,030
You have no idea,
sitting in the live‑stream booth,

14
00:02:47,430 --> 00:02:48,470
I could barely hear

15
00:02:48,470 --> 00:02:50,800
what the other commentators were saying.

16
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:53,120
I didn't care about the score.

17
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:55,400
I didn't care if JCU won or lost,

18
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:57,130
or if they were ahead or behind.

19
00:03:00,470 --> 00:03:01,870
Because every single second

20
00:03:01,870 --> 00:03:03,870
was pure agony for me.

21
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:06,870
I just watched you

22
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,310
frowning in pain.

23
00:03:12,310 --> 00:03:13,800
It broke my heart.

24
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:20,000
I don't ever want to see your knee
get hurt again.

25
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,490
I can't stand this. Do you understand?

26
00:03:44,030 --> 00:03:45,910
Will you come to the finals?

27
00:04:31,980 --> 00:04:33,000
Will you come

28
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:34,850
to the finals?

29
00:04:38,659 --> 00:04:40,040
Gu Han is playing through injury,

30
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:42,060
so he's far from being at full strength.

31
00:04:42,060 --> 00:04:44,040
Losing the team's second‑highest scorer

32
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:46,360
makes this incredibly tough for JCU.

33
00:04:56,840 --> 00:05:00,650
[Bai Xue Entertainment]

34
00:04:57,190 --> 00:04:57,830
Mr. Zhao,

35
00:04:58,270 --> 00:05:00,870
both projects are moving forward
smoothly right now.

36
00:05:00,870 --> 00:05:01,950
In a few days, we...

37
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:02,990
Hello?

38
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,270
Mr. Zhao?

39
00:05:09,010 --> 00:05:13,760
[Bai Xue Entertainment]

40
00:05:13,190 --> 00:05:13,920
What is it?

41
00:05:15,990 --> 00:05:16,600
Ms. Bai,

42
00:05:17,390 --> 00:05:18,520
I want to talk to you.

43
00:05:21,270 --> 00:05:21,870
Go ahead.

44
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:24,960
How long do we have to play

45
00:05:25,890 --> 00:05:27,950
these streetball exhibition games?

46
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,310
Those basketball variety shows

47
00:05:30,310 --> 00:05:31,800
have to be arranged by the company.

48
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:33,040
There are limited spots.

49
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:33,950
Go back and wait.

50
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:35,159
I'll let you know when there's news.

51
00:05:34,659 --> 00:05:44,150
[Bai Xue Entertainment]

52
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:39,300
Ms. Bai,
how much longer do I have to wait?

53
00:05:39,510 --> 00:05:41,070
When I signed the contract,
you promised me

54
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:42,510
you'd get me on a variety show soon,

55
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:44,000
instead of playing streetball
with these amateur players

56
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:45,040
every day.

57
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:53,750
What? Do you regret it?

58
00:05:54,430 --> 00:05:57,159
If you regret it,
you can terminate the contract.

59
00:05:58,390 --> 00:05:59,750
I... I didn't mean that.

60
00:05:59,770 --> 00:06:01,090
Then what do you mean?

61
00:06:01,410 --> 00:06:03,600
You think you're the only player
in the company?

62
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,260
What about the other players?

63
00:06:05,310 --> 00:06:06,680
Of course, we have to consider everything

64
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,830
and recommend the best.

65
00:06:07,830 --> 00:06:09,720
If everyone were as impatient
and opportunistic as you,

66
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,600
coming to make a scene,

67
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,860
would this company still have any rules?

68
00:06:15,390 --> 00:06:17,000
So you're saying

69
00:06:18,020 --> 00:06:19,280
I'm not as good as them?

70
00:06:24,350 --> 00:06:25,140
Sirui.

71
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,040
When I signed you,

72
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,950
I saw huge potential in you.

73
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:32,560
Right now
you should focus on improving yourself

74
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:35,200
and trust the company's arrangements.

75
00:06:35,390 --> 00:06:36,920
I won't treat you unfairly.

76
00:06:39,830 --> 00:06:40,920
But

77
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:43,190
don't take my expectations

78
00:06:43,310 --> 00:06:44,680
for granted.

79
00:06:45,190 --> 00:06:46,250
Do you understand?

80
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,520
I understand.

81
00:07:05,750 --> 00:07:06,680
Hold it, hold it.

82
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:08,110
Stop! Go!

83
00:07:08,610 --> 00:07:09,200
Get back!

84
00:07:14,590 --> 00:07:15,530
What are you looking at?

85
00:07:15,530 --> 00:07:16,590
What are you doing?

86
00:07:16,830 --> 00:07:17,630
You pushed me!

87
00:07:17,950 --> 00:07:19,150
What's your problem?

88
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,560
Come on, loser!

89
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,390
Game over!

90
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,310
Black team wins.

91
00:07:22,310 --> 00:07:23,160
Black team wins.

92
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,120
Step back!

93
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:43,950
Why are you guys here?

94
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:56,120
Oh, right.

95
00:07:56,630 --> 00:07:58,230
I haven't congratulated you

96
00:07:58,950 --> 00:08:00,410
on making it to the finals.

97
00:08:01,310 --> 00:08:02,040
Not bad.

98
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:06,950
Sirui.

99
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,880
How have you been lately?

100
00:08:14,070 --> 00:08:14,800
Pretty good.

101
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:19,120
Pretty good.

102
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,270
Pretty good signing with Bai Xue

103
00:08:20,270 --> 00:08:22,400
and letting you play this kind of game?

104
00:08:28,070 --> 00:08:29,000
Just warming up.

105
00:08:29,950 --> 00:08:31,950
But I have a basketball variety show

106
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,600
coming up soon.

107
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,630
A basketball variety show?

108
00:08:35,630 --> 00:08:37,510
So we'll be able to see you online?

109
00:08:39,270 --> 00:08:40,150
Maybe.

110
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,440
Alright.

111
00:08:45,630 --> 00:08:47,430
I'm heading back to the company.

112
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,260
Talk later.

113
00:08:50,550 --> 00:08:51,150
Oh, right.

114
00:08:54,750 --> 00:08:56,150
Go win the championship.

115
00:09:05,670 --> 00:09:06,360
Sirui.

116
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,440
Actually, Tian has always kept you

117
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,630
on the game roster.

118
00:09:13,260 --> 00:09:15,400
He said that no matter what,

119
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:18,130
you helped the team
reach the quarterfinals.

120
00:09:18,270 --> 00:09:20,240
If we win the championship in the end,

121
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:22,700
everyone must remember your contribution.

122
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,360
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

123
00:10:28,250 --> 00:10:30,470
Sirui, I want to talk to you.

124
00:10:30,790 --> 00:10:32,390
Are you free this afternoon?

125
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:55,320
Sorry to keep you waiting, Xiangxiang.

126
00:11:01,390 --> 00:11:02,200
Sirui.

127
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:05,510
I asked you out this time to ask you

128
00:11:07,510 --> 00:11:10,440
if there's any chance
you could return to the JCU Team

129
00:11:10,790 --> 00:11:12,030
for the finals.

130
00:11:30,870 --> 00:11:33,270
I didn't tell anyone
I was coming to see you,

131
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:35,360
so whatever answer you give me,

132
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,910
it stays between us.

133
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,600
Gu Han is injured.

134
00:11:43,870 --> 00:11:44,720
I really don't know

135
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:46,920
if he can last until the finals are over.

136
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,100
I tried to persuade him

137
00:11:50,270 --> 00:11:51,670
to heal his injury first,

138
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:54,010
but he's really insistent.

139
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:57,300
Our opponent in the finals

140
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,440
is the defending champion,
Zhonghai University.

141
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:00,770
Their lineup is intact,

142
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:02,950
and you know how strong they are.

143
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,030
Right now, it's not just Gu Han—

144
00:12:06,030 --> 00:12:06,790
Tian

145
00:12:06,790 --> 00:12:08,990
and the entire JCU Team really need you.

146
00:12:10,910 --> 00:12:12,480
You're only one game away

147
00:12:12,630 --> 00:12:14,760
from fulfilling the promise you made.

148
00:12:17,910 --> 00:12:19,120
Can you come back?

149
00:12:31,630 --> 00:12:32,840
I really can't.

150
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,860
I've already signed with Bai Xue.

151
00:12:36,510 --> 00:12:37,670
Violating the company's arrangements

152
00:12:37,670 --> 00:12:39,730
and playing in other games privately

153
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,690
is a breach of contract.

154
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,480
I can't afford it.

155
00:12:46,460 --> 00:12:47,590
I have no choice.

156
00:12:50,550 --> 00:12:51,280
Xiangxiang,

157
00:12:53,070 --> 00:12:53,780
I'm sorry.

158
00:13:12,210 --> 00:13:14,160
[UBA National Finals][Zhonghai University]
[Jiangcheng University]

159
00:13:16,190 --> 00:13:20,450
[UBA National Finals][Zhonghai University]
[Jiangcheng University]

160
00:13:19,750 --> 00:13:20,550
Everyone,

161
00:13:20,910 --> 00:13:22,630
the JCU Basketball Team

162
00:13:22,630 --> 00:13:24,200
will represent our school

163
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:26,850
in the National Finals
of the College Basketball League.

164
00:13:26,850 --> 00:13:29,610
♪ The night sky under which we first met ♪

165
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:30,440
This is JCU Team's first finals appearance
in eight years.

166
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:32,290
♪ The passion
has been engraved in my heart ♪

167
00:13:30,550 --> 00:13:33,480
Every player will surely give it their all

168
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:35,700
♪ White clothes are soaked in dreams ♪

169
00:13:33,510 --> 00:13:35,970
to win back the championship
for our school.

170
00:13:37,110 --> 00:13:39,210
♪ In an instant, back to that time ♪

171
00:13:39,790 --> 00:13:41,870
♪ Outside the sports field,
the innocence of first sight ♪

172
00:13:42,250 --> 00:13:46,010
♪ Sunlight reflecting the thrill
of the arc ♪

173
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:45,750
Nice shot! Next group!

174
00:13:45,620 --> 00:13:49,190
[Jiangcheng University
Sports and Cultural Center]

175
00:13:46,420 --> 00:13:50,280
♪ Enjoy this touching moment ♪

176
00:13:51,070 --> 00:13:55,010
♪ Forget the hesitation ♪

177
00:13:57,150 --> 00:14:01,300
♪ The sweat between hair is dropping ♪

178
00:13:57,550 --> 00:13:58,960
Get the layup right!

179
00:14:01,330 --> 00:14:06,180
♪ Shining for the bright future ♪

180
00:14:06,570 --> 00:14:07,200
Again!

181
00:14:06,850 --> 00:14:10,350
♪ Rush despite the fierce wind and rain ♪

182
00:14:06,990 --> 00:14:07,710
[Striving]

183
00:14:10,630 --> 00:14:13,140
♪ Be as free as like wind ♪

184
00:14:13,280 --> 00:14:16,860
♪ Dreams will break the end of the world ♪

185
00:14:17,250 --> 00:14:20,540
♪ The power of light
encompasses the universe ♪

186
00:14:20,780 --> 00:14:22,890
♪ Even if we
go against the ocean currents ♪

187
00:14:22,910 --> 00:14:28,080
♪ We'll still
cut through the sky with our arms ♪

188
00:14:25,430 --> 00:14:27,910
[Challenge]

189
00:15:00,030 --> 00:15:01,630
Can you finish it in one bite?

190
00:15:03,090 --> 00:15:04,010
Okay, okay.

191
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:25,960
Hello, sir. How many of you?

192
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:26,560
Just one.

193
00:15:26,590 --> 00:15:27,850
Okay, this way please.

194
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:30,220
Sir, what would you like to order?

195
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:31,440
Let me see.

196
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:39,820
I heard Yue Hong from Zhonghai
is back from studying abroad.

197
00:15:39,820 --> 00:15:41,910
Chen Hongbin's also returned from injury.

198
00:15:41,910 --> 00:15:43,240
Their strength is not the same
as it was in the divisional round,

199
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:45,570
when it was just Wang Zihao carrying them.

200
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:46,790
I actually think

201
00:15:46,870 --> 00:15:47,790
that although Zhonghai's Big Three

202
00:15:47,790 --> 00:15:49,360
have strong individual skills,

203
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:51,260
JCU's team cohesion is quite good.

204
00:15:51,260 --> 00:15:52,630
-But don't forget,
-This.

205
00:15:52,630 --> 00:15:54,550
JCU hasn't made the finals in eight years.

206
00:15:54,550 --> 00:15:56,750
They can't match Zhonghai in experience.

207
00:15:56,750 --> 00:15:58,120
This season, they were almost knocked out

208
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,720
of the national tournament by Zhonghai.

209
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:02,380
They might be at
a psychological disadvantage.

210
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:05,860
That's all.

211
00:16:23,630 --> 00:16:25,630
Who would've thought,
after we said ''see you at nationals'',

212
00:16:25,630 --> 00:16:27,690
you'd actually make it to the finals.

213
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:30,240
Since we made a promise,
I couldn't skip it.

214
00:16:30,660 --> 00:16:32,790
We're not the same Zhonghai as before.

215
00:16:34,750 --> 00:16:36,750
And we're not the same JCU as before.

216
00:16:47,910 --> 00:16:48,600
By the way,

217
00:16:49,910 --> 00:16:52,310
I heard you suffered
a serious knee injury.

218
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:53,330
Are you okay?

219
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,080
Tomorrow—

220
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:57,170
can you play?

221
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:03,050
I'd hate to beat you when you're hurt,

222
00:17:03,050 --> 00:17:05,710
people will say I took advantage
of your injury.

223
00:17:10,650 --> 00:17:12,579
Basketball isn't a one‑man sport.

224
00:17:14,270 --> 00:17:16,470
Bring everything you've got tomorrow.

225
00:17:19,349 --> 00:17:20,200
Tomorrow,

226
00:17:22,030 --> 00:17:23,630
I will definitely go all out.

227
00:17:27,069 --> 00:17:27,829
Who won't?

228
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:32,450
I'm leaving.

229
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:33,510
It's on me.

230
00:18:05,760 --> 00:18:07,890
[Mom]

231
00:18:05,790 --> 00:18:08,880
Han, I'll arrive in Jiangcheng
early tomorrow morning.

232
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:10,810
Good luck tomorrow. See you there.

233
00:18:10,850 --> 00:18:13,100
[Mom]

234
00:18:13,010 --> 00:18:13,940
Waiting for you.

235
00:18:25,520 --> 00:18:28,270
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

236
00:18:33,190 --> 00:18:36,020
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

237
00:18:34,300 --> 00:18:35,630
Will you come tomorrow?

238
00:18:40,980 --> 00:18:43,030
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

239
00:18:54,070 --> 00:18:55,350
Because of their first matchup,

240
00:18:55,350 --> 00:18:57,960
plus the return of Zhonghai's
two star players,

241
00:18:57,960 --> 00:18:59,160
the outside world is almost

242
00:18:58,480 --> 00:18:58,960
[The Starry Sky]

243
00:18:58,960 --> 00:18:59,580
[Guo Chuang, Coach]

244
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:01,000
unanimously favoring Zhonghai
to defend their title.

245
00:18:59,580 --> 00:19:00,580
[Former Instructor
of University Basketball Association]

246
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:04,440
Many people think JCU's run to the finals

247
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:05,640
was down to luck.

248
00:19:05,570 --> 00:19:05,940
[The Starry Sky]

249
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:07,680
But after these past games,

250
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,350
[Host: Zhoug Xiangxiang]

251
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:10,080
the whole team has made great progress.

252
00:19:10,110 --> 00:19:11,790
Chen Yu's shooting percentage on key shots

253
00:19:11,790 --> 00:19:12,920
has improved a lot.

254
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:14,240
And Kong Fang's playing time

255
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,640
has also increased a lot.

256
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:17,590
Zhou Yunze fouls easily,

257
00:19:17,590 --> 00:19:18,350
but in these few games,

258
00:19:18,350 --> 00:19:20,960
he's managed to keep it
to around three or four.

259
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:21,860
What about Gu Han?

260
00:19:21,860 --> 00:19:23,730
As the star player,

261
00:19:23,410 --> 00:19:25,160
[The Starry Sky]

262
00:19:23,760 --> 00:19:26,160
how do you think he performed
in this stage?

263
00:19:28,750 --> 00:19:31,350
Gu Han's individual ability goes
without saying.

264
00:19:31,350 --> 00:19:32,240
I think

265
00:19:32,300 --> 00:19:33,440
this time he's played

266
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:34,720
an even more important role,

267
00:19:34,370 --> 00:19:37,060
[The Starry Sky]

268
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:37,270
inspiring all his teammates mentally.

269
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:38,680
For this championship,

270
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:40,640
he has put in a lot of effort.

271
00:19:41,030 --> 00:19:43,440
He kept going even with a knee injury.

272
00:19:44,270 --> 00:19:46,480
I hope he plays within his limits

273
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:47,720
and protects himself.

274
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:49,720
I still have high hopes for JCU Team.

275
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:52,270
I promise you.

276
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:54,650
In tomorrow's game,

277
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:56,960
I will protect myself.

278
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:09,510
Gu Han's knee has severe fluid buildup.

279
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:11,610
His patellar tendon

280
00:20:12,510 --> 00:20:13,750
